[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4078726726","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117545#issuecomment-4078726726","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117545","id":4078726726,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zHG5G","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-17T23:49:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T10:36:52Z","body":"Below is a full summary of what this PR fixed:\r\n(i.e. only the tooltip for the shadowed `PI` has changed)\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nclass_name _Main # Shows tooltip _Main.\r\nextends Node # Shows tooltip Node.\r\n\r\nvar PI = -10 # Shows tooltip @GDScript.PI. <-- Fixed! Now shows _Main.PI.\r\nvar OK = -20 # Shows tooltip _Main.OK.\r\n\r\nenum Error { # Shows tooltip _Main.Error.\r\n\tOK = -30 # No tooltip.\r\n}\r\nvar Side = -40 # Shows tooltip _Main.Side.\r\nvar MouseButtonMask = -50 # Shows tooltip _Main.MouseButtonMask.\r\n\r\nvar number = -60 # Shows tooltip _Main.number.\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar _a = PI # Shows tooltip @GDScript.PI. <-- Fixed! Now shows _Main.PI.\r\n\tvar _b = TAU # Shows tooltip @GDScript.TAU.\r\n\tvar _c = OK # Shows tooltip _Main.OK.\r\n\tvar _d = FAILED # Shows tooltip @GlobalScope.FAILED.\r\n\tvar _e = Error # Shows tooltip _Main.Error.\r\n\tvar _f = Error.OK # Shows tooltips _Main.Error and _Main.Error.OK.\r\n\t#var _g = Error.FAILED # Shows tooltip _Main.Error.\r\n\tvar _h = Side # Shows tooltip _Main.Side.\r\n\t#var _i = ClockDirection # Shows tooltip @GlobalScope.ClockDirection.\r\n\tvar _j = MouseButtonMask # Shows tooltips _Main.MouseButtonMask.\r\n\t#var _k = JoyButton # Shows tooltips @GlobalScope.@JoyButton.\r\n\tvar _z = number # Shows _Main.number.\r\n\t\r\n\tprint(_a) # Prints -10\r\n\tprint(_b) # Prints 6.28318530717959\r\n\tprint(_c) # Prints -20\r\n\tprint(_d) # Prints 1\r\n\tprint(_e) # Prints { \"OK\": -30 }\r\n\tprint(_f) # Prints -30\r\n\tprint(_h) # Prints -40\r\n\tprint(_j) # Prints -50\r\n\tprint(_z) # Prints -60\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4078726726/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750667803","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117545#issuecomment-4750667803","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117545","id":4750667803,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGylwGw","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChan